1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","children":[["$","$Ld",null,{"eyebrow":"Build the foundation","title":"Noorani Qaida for Beginners","description":"Live one-to-one Noorani Qaida classes for children and adults learning Arabic letters, sounds, joining and the foundations of Quran reading.","compact":true,"children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"button button-ivory","href":"/free-assessment/","children":["Book free assessment ",["$","$Lb",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right"}]]}],["$","$Le",null,{"className":"button button-ghost-light","children":[["$","$Lb",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719","key":"1sd12s"}]],"className":"lucide-message-circle"}]," Ask about this course"]}]]}],["$","$Lf",null,{"items":[{"name":"Home","href":"/"},{"name":"Courses","href":"/courses/"},{"name":"Noorani Qaida for Beginners"}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section section-paper","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell content-grid","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"prose","children":[[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Course overview"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Learn Noorani Qaida online from the first letter"}],[["$","p","Noorani Qaida is a structured starting point for learners who cannot yet read Arabic confidently. It introduces Arabic letters and their sounds before moving gradually into joined forms, vowel marks and simple Quranic words. Instead of asking a beginner to guess or memorize a page, the tutor demonstrates each sound, listens to the learner and corrects mistakes as they appear.",{"children":"Noorani Qaida is a structured starting point for learners who cannot yet read Arabic confidently. It introduces Arabic letters and their sounds before moving gradually into joined forms, vowel marks and simple Quranic words. Instead of asking a beginner to guess or memorize a page, the tutor demonstrates each sound, listens to the learner and corrects mistakes as they appear."}],["$","p","QuranCrest teaches this foundation through live one-to-one lessons. The starting lesson is selected after a free assessment, so a complete beginner can begin with individual letters while a returning learner can restart from the first skill that needs correction. The aim is not to rush through the book; it is to develop reading habits that prepare the learner for guided Quran reading.",{"children":"QuranCrest teaches this foundation through live one-to-one lessons. The starting lesson is selected after a free assessment, so a complete beginner can begin with individual letters while a returning learner can restart from the first skill that needs correction. The aim is not to rush through the book; it is to develop reading habits that prepare the learner for guided Quran reading."}]],["$","h2",null,{"children":"What the learner can work toward"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"outcome-grid","children":[["$","div","Recognize Arabic letters in different forms",{"className":"outcome-item","children":[["$","$Lb",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["circle",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10","key":"1mglay"}],["path",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4","key":"dzmm74"}]],"className":"lucide-circle-check"}]," ","Recognize Arabic letters in different forms"]}],["$","div","Join letters and read short words",{"className":"outcome-item","children":[["$","$Lb",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1:props:children:2:props:children:props:children:0:props:children:0:4:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-circle-check"}]," ","Join letters and read short words"]}],["$","div","Build accurate pronunciation habits",{"className":"outcome-item","children":[["$","$Lb",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1:props:children:2:props:children:props:children:0:props:children:0:4:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-circle-check"}]," ","Build accurate pronunciation habits"]}],["$","div","Prepare for guided Quran reading",{"className":"outcome-item","children":["$L10"," ","Prepare for guided Quran reading"]}]]}],"$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18",["$L19","$L1a"],false,"$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"],"$L21","$L22"]}],"$L23"]}]}],"$L24","$L25","$L26"]}]
